.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-34-- Each `Rxx` is one visually observed horizontal printed row, not one
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-35-  equation component, prose sentence, or machine-detected band.
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-36-- Inline mathematics and tall fractions/integrals belong to their printed
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-37-  row; stacked numerator/denominator ink does not add rows.
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md:38:- Two exercises or a caption and prose sharing a horizontal row count once.
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-39-- Figure-internal labels, axes, curves, and grid ink are inventoried
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-40-  separately and excluded from the text-row totals. Figure captions and
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-41-  footer rows are included.
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-42-- `y~` is an approximate native-pixel row center recorded from visual
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-43-  observation, not a measured segmentation boundary or machine witness.
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md:44:- `UNKNOWN` preserves undecidable glyphs or unobserved boundaries.
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-45-  No formula is repaired from mathematical expectations.
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-46-- The visually a-shaped/б-shaped subitem pair in 509 is encoded `а)`/`б)`
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-47-  in accordance with the specified faithful-source convention. The
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-48-  а-shaped glyph alone cannot prove its Unicode script.
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-49-- Inequality glyphs with a visibly slanted lower stroke are transcribed
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-50-  `\leqslant`/`\geqslant`. Bold real/natural-set letters are transcribed
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-51-  `\mathbf{R}`/`\mathbf{N}`, without changing them to a different typeface.
.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-184/tmp/production-source10c140-143-review/source-first.md-52-- Row-table spaces separate physical runs, not claimed literal spacing.
